//cap-sources.s3.amazonaws.com/ly-nmc-ar/rss.xml","title_en":"Thunderstorms on the eastern parts may be locally heavy","summary_en":"Clouds proliferate with thunderstorms of varying intensity between moderate and heavy, may be severely locally heavy during this Saturday on the north-eastern areas (extending from Gulf to Imsaid and the regions of Mount Green and its south) leading to water collection in low places, floods and flowing some local valleys with wind activity while passing through thunder cells.","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)"},{"title":"امطار رعدية على مناطق الشمال الغربى والجنوب الغربى قد تكون غزيرة محليا","summary":"تكاثر للسحب وسقوط أمطار رعدية متفاوتة الشدة بين المتوسطة والغزيرة ،قد تكون شديدة الغزارة محليا خلال فترات المساء من هذا اليوم الجمعة ويوم الغد على بعض الاماكن وبالاخص على (مناطق الجبل الغربي وجنوبه-مزدة-الشويرف- القريات - ترهونة-مسلاتة-بني وليد وماجاورها - الحمادة – غدامس – وادي الشاطئ - غات وماجاورها – اوباري – سبها – منطقة الجفرة -الهروج –سرت وماجاورها -وكذلك بعض مناطق الساحل الغربي وسهل الجفارة","date":"2026-09-25T09:25","link":"https://cap-sources.s3.amazonaws.com/ly-nmc-ar/2026-09-25-09-25-17.xml","severity":"","source":"","agency":"Libya National Meteorological Center (CAP, via the alert hub's public source bucket)","lang":"ar","feed":"https://cap-sources.s3.amazonaws.com/ly-nmc-ar/rss.xml","title_en":"Thunderstorms in north-west and south-west areas, may be locally heavy","summary_en":"Clouds and thunderstorms of varying intensity, from moderate to heavy, may occur locally in the evening on Friday and tomorrow in some areas, especially in the western mountains and southern parts of them, Mazdah, Shu &apos; irf, Qiryat Tharounah, Massalatah, Bani Walid and its neighbourhoods, Hamdah, Gaddamis, Wadi al-Shati, Ghat and its neghbourhoods and Obari, Sebaa, Jufrah, Al-Harroug, Sirte and other areas. - as well as some areas of the west coast and Jafarah plain","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)"}],"mz":[],"pa":[{"title":"LLUVIAS Y TORMENTAS","summary":"Para las próximas horas se espera la incursión de la onda tropical #48 al territorio nacional, además de la vaguada monzónica al norte del país y el contenido de humedad elevado; estos factores estarán manteniendo una atmósfera inestable. Debido a esto, se prevén acumulados de lluvias con valores alto (entre 201 a 280 milímetros) en los sectores montañosos de Bocas del Toro, comarca Ngäbe-Buglé, C","date":"2026-09-25T19:41","link":"https://cap-sources.s3.amazonaws.com/pa-imhpa-es/2026-09-25-19-41-33.xml","severity":"","source":"","agency":"Panama IMHPA (CAP, via the alert hub's public source bucket)","lang":"es","feed":"https://cap-sources.s3.amazonaws.com/pa-imhpa-es/rss.xml","title_en":"RAINS AND STORM","summary_en":"For the next few hours, we expect Tropical Wave #48 to enter national territory, in addition to monsoon waves in the north of the country and high humidity content; these factors will be maintaining an unstable atmosphere. Due to this, accumulated rainfall with high values (between 201 and 280 millimeters) are forecast in the mountainous sectors of Bocas del Toro, Ngäbe-Buglé region, C","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)"}],"sn":[]}};
